#lego-legacy-route 1
# Hot Wheels Stunt Track Driver, from a clean profile through Championship
# Tracks 1-6, unlocking and earning a Gold Medal on the hidden 7th track
# (WIRE) with 0 crashes, and out on Escape (#305, #306).
#
# Per-track active gameplay flip windows and save landmarks:
#   Boot -> Main Menu:       Space at flip 285 skips intro; Championship entered
#                            via clicks at 385, 463, 539, 569, 631, 696.
#   Track 1 (HOUS):          696..2812   (saves\times.dat at flip 3245)
#   Track 2 (TOYS):          3692..5619  (saves\times.dat at flip 5704)
#   Track 3 (ATRI):          6151..8276  (saves\times.dat + onoff.dat at 8330)
#   Track 4 (ATIC):          8843..10646 (saves\times.dat at flip 10767)
#   Track 5 (SAND):          11249..14175 (saves\times.dat at flip 14301)
#   Track 6 (BASE):          14748..16486 (saves\times.dat + onoff.dat at 16598;
#                            saves\onoff.dat = 01 00 00 00 x 6 + 00 00 00 00, 28 B)
#   Secret Track 7 Unlock:   Return to Main Menu (17711), Track Select (17811),
#                            right-click Mattel "TT" hotspot (17889..17894),
#                            Track Select settled (17919), Track/Car Green GO
#                            (17925, 17999) keeping Gold Twin Mill (car10).
#   Track 7 (WIRE):          17999..20703 (active gameplay window)
#                            Grid lights (18125), mouse steering armed (18120),
#                            green-light Rocket Start via LMB (18128), 12 ramp
#                            barrel-roll sequences (LeftShift) with 1-flip mid-air
#                            yaw balance (Left/Right) for 54 stunts and 0 crashes.
#                            High-speed inverted stunt over wireframe valley (18460,
#                            18960), wireframe tunnel (19750), finish in 1:08
#                            (68.211 s, Gold Medal <= 1:11, 0 crashes), writing
#                            saves\times.dat (Track 7 entry[0] = 68 s, car10) at
#                            flip 20755. Click at 20860..20865 advances past the
#                            Gold Medal fireworks show to the 1:08 Gold Medal
#                            results screen (20875); Escape at 20876 quits cleanly
#                            three flips later (exited 1 at flip 20879).
